You can't lowlevel format with a RX01 or RX02 drive at all, they need
preformatted floppies. But you can format them in 3740-format in any
other machine capable of formatting floppies (26spt, 128bps, FM, SS).
You can only change between RX01 and RX02 format with a RX02 drive
(using FORMAT).
